            <div xml:id="m-64416e96-0ec4-4ad9-9bc6-2b7fc32bbdbb">
              <lg xml:id="m-b26007de-6fdc-46fc-8684-4cf25f11d197">
                <l xml:id="m-0ca8b2ed-2cb7-4273-814e-529bc1db8a59" facs="#m-11eeebd0-977e-4856-b1db-b109faa78d23" label="ambiguous">308</l><l xml:id="m-2a101121-4c02-459d-ab93-7c0971645966" facs="#m-74f398ea-d207-4dcc-9eff-609f0cc217ef" label="text-like">Saturday at Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-bda5029e-6cfa-4419-975f-e5bd9e775e0b" facs="#m-bb4f20ca-61ab-4068-b02f-ad2502a42dd3" label="lyrics-like">3. Protéctor méus et in ipso sperávi :* qui súbdit pópulum méum sub</l><l xml:id="m-a04a935a-f03e-43e8-8f36-18a63dd9fbdc" facs="#m-e896ca5b-fdd3-471b-9011-82c4ef0a21e0" label="ambiguous">me.</l><l xml:id="m-96b282f2-7f49-4a9b-a5d2-3e2a023f4f34" facs="#m-38df3f89-938d-400f-a4c4-a6ad8309dbec" label="lyrics-like">4. Dómine, quid est hómo, quia innotuisti éi? *aut filius hóminis,</l><l xml:id="m-bab926d1-76d4-4f6f-a717-0ff2bb07fc55" facs="#m-0f39f45c-8605-44aa-94ab-4817b346ade3" label="lyrics-like">quia réputas éum?</l><l xml:id="m-97cf8eaa-e54f-4b79-aee2-b986adb44856" facs="#m-00b20606-ffcf-4857-ac3e-0546e2daeb8e" label="lyrics-like">5. Hómo vanitátisimilis fáctus est :* dies éjus sicut úmbra proetéreunt.</l><l xml:id="m-a5a2236d-5cc8-4352-a079-f822fd3155bc" facs="#m-a73dd5cf-0e3e-4413-a189-6ce03f2a6aeb" label="lyrics-like">6. Dómine inclína caélos túos, et descénde :* tánge móntes, et fumi¬</l><l xml:id="m-3a34bdc6-9163-4958-a396-992089ff5709" facs="#m-d86f694e-a475-45c8-b31b-96c3f59dbe68" label="lyrics-like">gábunt.</l><l xml:id="m-ffaca457-e7ce-4fbd-9a2c-b7dc62196e22" facs="#m-5e4c4638-b94f-4bb7-a622-c3ad34e6be1f" label="lyrics-like">7. Fúlgura coruscatiónem, et dissipábis éos:* emitte sagittas túas, et</l><l xml:id="m-05348c56-12e9-4040-9dce-1afe4cb90493" facs="#m-0c6eeff8-a601-45db-9b95-418491caa76a" label="lyrics-like">conturbábis éos.</l><l xml:id="m-1571cd14-6b94-47be-acca-c374c7014d74" facs="#m-62937650-70c9-41ce-8458-ee89d96cc193" label="lyrics-like">8. Emitte mánum túam de álto, t éripe me et libera me de áquis</l><l xml:id="m-277c9857-09b5-487c-831c-87fa238193d4" facs="#m-d3ca4a3a-ec8b-4a4c-88f6-be7faa599d24" label="lyrics-like">múltis:* de mánu filiórum atienórum.</l><l xml:id="m-ab254e72-fce9-4554-a673-dcabf0fd6a6c" facs="#m-4b368fbb-c32c-4caa-bd69-8512af073bbf" label="lyrics-like">9. Quórum os locútum est vanitâtem:“et déxtera eórum, déxtera</l><l xml:id="m-5fe095e7-8964-450f-8908-3f0f86f27f6c" facs="#m-31e81794-ed40-4409-9f82-69b0764d4d8d" label="lyrics-like">iniquitãtis.</l><l xml:id="m-33122404-8a6e-4edf-ac18-fff0724ed3c9" facs="#m-7be50753-2aff-4a2f-98d0-9b5e821994ce" label="lyrics-like">10. Glória Pátri, et Filio, “ et Spirítu! Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-4e22f3b1-6edf-4007-82c2-d0f51c3c54e4" facs="#m-795f570c-022d-4fad-b3aa-481ebdfc482f" label="lyrics-like">11. Sicut érat in principio, et nunc, et sémper, * et in saécula saeculó¬</l><l xml:id="m-2aef5615-51c9-46ed-8954-739882f4e5b8" facs="#m-00e14481-2608-44e4-86f1-12757b69f82c" label="ambiguous">ram. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-a7d1a965-899b-47f5-9281-11805ec52ee8" facs="#m-d7562186-7640-4784-9e0c-0e327d94796c" label="lyrics-like">P. T. Ps. Déus cánticum nóvum cantábo tibi. 6. F. 192.</l><l xml:id="m-59a2a6f2-7e15-4e5e-825c-7068d211f96c" facs="#m-c1a39375-a794-4fa4-8b20-b786b9a7f22f" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-f0c0f00d-f857-4f02-b2da-c6782c20a499" facs="#m-b27c20ca-7f55-4cd1-9361-b8172ba8e4f5" label="ambiguous">et libe¬</l><l xml:id="m-7b4a599f-9003-4734-b2e0-2dc20ac1e91e" facs="#m-2d6f6c7c-92af-4aa4-a10d-7a9edd6a4782" label="lyrics-like">Benedíctus Dómi-nus suscéptor mé-us</l><l xml:id="m-4d5770c6-01f4-48ee-aaec-1bca768c684a" facs="#m-dbf23015-8d77-4098-9951-394d10da04fb" label="lyrics-like">rátor mé¬ us.</l><l xml:id="m-14cb4971-e494-4e54-982e-049363a14f12" facs="#m-d7f20b28-1acc-4e4d-8d62-25f769886322" label="ambiguous">2.Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-a52569ee-8ac6-4d55-a2b3-ff87e2d5d106" facs="#m-0dd570ab-683e-4722-a722-bb64e8931b3e" label="ambiguous">s.e</l><l xml:id="m-51c8c1ea-5a4e-45b5-a86e-216f72fc71ef" facs="#m-1f3de1fc-4983-49b4-b031-fd3dc5eaac3a" label="lyrics-like">E-á-tus pópulus.</l><l xml:id="m-ee62004c-b417-427a-a2bc-eeaf5a0bffdf" facs="#m-d3486ba4-f004-46d3-ae7b-9784a36136cf" label="ambiguous">Psalm 143. HI.</l><l xml:id="m-ab25bdc9-5bcb-435a-ae2e-c537bef83f83" facs="#m-328cb663-70cf-42ae-bf50-b564834f3cfd" label="lyrics-like">1. Dé-us cánticum nóvum cantábo ti- bi:"in psaltéri-o,</l><l xml:id="m-66b0eb9e-23cf-4f85-8afc-4227409ece6d" facs="#m-748ec52c-a448-47df-a905-e5128fdb1104" label="ambiguous">G</l><l xml:id="m-3822c749-0888-4808-93d0-5662dacd7aae" facs="#m-82d7375a-46b7-4ab4-96da-5a3b381b2bf1" label="lyrics-like">decachórdo psállam tibi. opállam tíbi. r:psállam</l><l xml:id="m-1ef9022a-56a5-4f64-bd6a-4ee68b975892" facs="#m-d8f5f7df-815a-4a9c-b6d2-5e5c8e1cd55d" label="ambiguous">G</l><l xml:id="m-6423cacc-0a71-44a1-99bb-0baf10ef5305" facs="#m-12699200-ebbd-48a0-b086-ae2e1913c635" label="lyrics-like">ti-bi. Flex: a-li-enórum, 1</l></lg>
